  "body": "## Defect\n\nThe mandatory pre-push hook called ordinary `--base` validation, but final-PR completion was enforced in every mode. This made the documented three-commit Bathcat \u2192 Mennonite \u2192 promotion protocol impossible: Bathcat could not push the immutable `ready_for_audit` parent that approval must bind to.\n\n## Repair\n\n- ordinary local/pre-push diff validation permits `ready_for_audit` and `approved` intermediate heads;\n- synthetic PR-merge and protected-main validation still require `promoted` plus canonical copy;\n- regression test proves all three modes.\n\n## Verification\n\n- intake/provenance/history suite: 43 passed, 1 intentional skip, 0 failed\n- `validate-intake --base origin/main`: clean\n- 2,625 OKFs clean + index fresh\n- visual suite: 5 passed\n- diff check clean",
  "closed_at": "2026-08-01T10:10:10Z",
